      "name": "Mohd Owaish Khan",
      "created_at": "2025-09-24T10:25:28.801Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The error is appearing from India Compliance because the account type set in the GST settings is incorrect.</p>\n<p>Go to GST Setting &gt; Account .<br>\nThen change the “Purchase Reverse Charge” to “Reverse Charge” .</p>\n<p>For more details : <a href=\"https://docs.indiacompliance.app/docs/configuration/gst_setup\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Configuring GST in ERPNext | India Compliance</a></p>",
